              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مخفر — makhfar — \"a police station\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ذهب الرجل إلى المخفر بعد الحادث. dhahaba ar-rajul ilā al-makhfar baʿda al-ḥādith. The man went to the police station after the accident."
